'<p>',
'This page is built on top of the <strong>EBA_DEMO_JSON_CUSTOMERS</strong> JSON data source and allows you to update a customer''s address. When an address is modified, the system automatically synchronizes the delivery address of related active orders'
||' using <strong>JSON_TRANSFORM</strong>. Only orders that are still using the customer''s original address are updated, while orders with customized delivery addresses remain unchanged.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'This demonstrates the power of <strong>JSON_TRANSFORM</strong>, which gives developers full control over JSON document updates through precise and explicit transformations, allowing them to manage every detail of the modification process.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'To get started, select a customer and update their address information. After saving the changes, the delivery addresses of related active orders are automatically synchronized where applicable.',
'</p>'))
