'<p>',
'This page provides a master-detail view of customers and their orders using the <strong>EBA_DEMO_JSON_CUSTOMER_ORDERS_DV</strong> Duality View. The master section displays customer information, while the detail section shows the related orders for th'
||'e selected customer, including order date and status. This layout allows easy navigation and exploration of customer activity in a single, unified interface.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
